      <h1 class="article-title">Epistle to the Philippians</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Polycarp &middot; c. 110–140</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">Polycarp’s letter to the church at Philippi, urging them to persevere in righteousness and warning against the love of money. Written in the shadow of Ignatius’s martyrdom, it is one of the earliest surviving Christian letters outside the New Testament.</p>
